* NOT FOR CONSTRUCTION — unreviewed design. Simulated results; models as stated; nothing has been built or measured.
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0
*
* stack_static_n5.cir — static (DC) sharing of ONE stack with FIVE devices (the I-3 proposal), otherwise as drawn on
* 11_hv_storage (stack A: Q1101..Q1104, sharing string R1107..R1110, C1101..C1104, gate resistors
* R1115..R1117 100 k, gate-source R1121..R1123 10 Mohm, TVS D1101..D1104 SMF15CA), dump resistors
* R1101..R1103 in series with the top. Bottom gate held at -vhold through 1 kohm (pump output, WP-F).
* Question I-3. The control script (stack_static.ctl) runs four configurations:
*   cfg 1: as drawn (IXTT10N100D2, 10 Mohm string, 100 k straight to the tap, 10 Mohm gate-source)
*   cfg 2: as drawn but IXTT2N170D2 (1,700 V)
*   cfg 3: PROPOSED gate steering (diode GP02-40 in each upper gate feed, bypassed by rpar; gate-source
*          raised to rgsfix) + stiffer string rstrfix, IXTT10N100D2
*   cfg 4: as cfg 3 with IXTT2N170D2
*   cfg 5: as cfg 4 plus a resistor rdsv and capacitor cdsv directly across EACH device (drain-source)
* Models: models/datasheet_models.lib (hand-built from datasheets; no maker model obtained).
.include models/datasheet_models.lib
.param nst=5
* configuration switches (altered by the control script)
.param dev=1 gatefix=0 rstrfix=4.7meg rpar=22meg rgsfix=100meg dsrc=0 rdsv=10meg cdsv=3.3n
.param rstr={gatefix ? rstrfix : 10meg}
.param rbyp={gatefix ? rpar : 0.01}
.param rgs={gatefix ? rgsfix : 10meg}
* device figures by part (see models file)
.param kpd={dev==1 ? 4 : 0.6} rdd={dev==1 ? 1.4 : 6.0} cgsd={dev==1 ? 5.25n : 3.57n}
.param cgdd={dev==1 ? 424p : 485p} cdsd={dev==1 ? 1.39n : 760p}
.param voffnom={dev==1 ? -3.5 : -3.0}
.param vrate={dev==1 ? 1000 : 1700} vratecold={dev==1 ? 940 : 1598}
.param leak25={dev==1 ? 100meg : 68meg} leak70={dev==1 ? 23.5meg : 17.7meg} leakm20={dev==1 ? 426meg : 262meg}
.param leakt=100meg vofft=1.0 vcap=2200 vhold=7.4
* per-element string tolerance; lk = fraction of max leakage (rleak = leakt/lk); vo = per-device cut-off
.param rt1=1 rt2=1 rt3=1 rt4=1 rt5=1
.param lk1=0.3 lk2=0.3 lk3=0.3 lk4=0.3 lk5=0.3
.param vo1=-3.5 vo2=-3.5 vo3=-3.5 vo4=-3.5 vo5=-3.5
.param rsh1=1e15 rsh2=1e15 rsh3=1e15 rsh4=1e15 rsh5=1e15
.param rso1=1e15 rso2=1e15 rso3=1e15 rso4=1e15 rso5=1e15

VCAP hvp 0 {vcap}
RD1 hvp d1 1.5k
RD2 d1 d2 1.5k
RD3 d2 top 1.5k
* bottom device (gate from the pump)
VH gh 0 {-vhold}
RH gh g1 1k
X1 m1 g1 0 DEPMOS params: voff={vo1*vofft} rleak={leakt/lk1} kp={kpd} rd={rdd} cgs={cgsd} cgd0={cgdd} cds0={cdsd}
XT1 g1 0 SMF15CA
RS1 m1 0 {rsh1}
RDS1 m1 0 {dsrc ? rdsv : 1e15}
CDS1 m1 0 {dsrc ? cdsv : 1p}
* upper devices: tap -> 100 k -> [steering diode || rbyp] -> gate; rgs gate-source; TVS gate-source
X2 m2 g2 m1 DEPMOS params: voff={vo2*vofft} rleak={leakt/lk2} kp={kpd} rd={rdd} cgs={cgsd} cgd0={cgdd} cds0={cdsd}
RG2 t1 x2 100k
XD2 x2 g2 GP0240
RB2 x2 g2 {rbyp}
RGS2 g2 m1 {rgs}
XT2 g2 m1 SMF15CA
RS2 m2 m1 {rsh2}
RDS2 m2 m1 {dsrc ? rdsv : 1e15}
CDS2 m2 m1 {dsrc ? cdsv : 1p}
X3 m3 g3 m2 DEPMOS params: voff={vo3*vofft} rleak={leakt/lk3} kp={kpd} rd={rdd} cgs={cgsd} cgd0={cgdd} cds0={cdsd}
RG3 t2 x3 100k
XD3 x3 g3 GP0240
RB3 x3 g3 {rbyp}
RGS3 g3 m2 {rgs}
XT3 g3 m2 SMF15CA
RS3 m3 m2 {rsh3}
RDS3 m3 m2 {dsrc ? rdsv : 1e15}
CDS3 m3 m2 {dsrc ? cdsv : 1p}
X4 m4 g4 m3 DEPMOS params: voff={vo4*vofft} rleak={leakt/lk4} kp={kpd} rd={rdd} cgs={cgsd} cgd0={cgdd} cds0={cdsd}
RG4 t3 x4 100k
XD4 x4 g4 GP0240
RB4 x4 g4 {rbyp}
RGS4 g4 m3 {rgs}
XT4 g4 m3 SMF15CA
RS4 m4 m3 {rsh4}
RDS4 m4 m3 {dsrc ? rdsv : 1e15}
CDS4 m4 m3 {dsrc ? cdsv : 1p}
* sharing string with 3.3 nF across each element; rso = string element shorted
RS_1 t1 0 {rstr*rt1}
RS_2 t2 t1 {rstr*rt2}
RS_3 t3 t2 {rstr*rt3}
RS_4 t4 t3 {rstr*rt4}
RX_1 t1 0 {rso1}
RX_2 t2 t1 {rso2}
RX_3 t3 t2 {rso3}
RX_4 t4 t3 {rso4}
C_1 t1 0 3.3n
C_2 t2 t1 3.3n
C_3 t3 t2 3.3n
C_4 t4 t3 3.3n
X5 top g5 m4 DEPMOS params: voff={vo5*vofft} rleak={leakt/lk5} kp={kpd} rd={rdd} cgs={cgsd} cgd0={cgdd} cds0={cdsd}
RG5 t4 x5 100k
XD5 x5 g5 GP0240
RB5 x5 g5 {rbyp}
RGS5 g5 m4 {rgs}
XT5 g5 m4 SMF15CA
RS5 top m4 {rsh5}
RDS5 top m4 {dsrc ? rdsv : 1e15}
CDS5 top m4 {dsrc ? cdsv : 1p}
RS_5 top t4 {rstr*rt5}
RX_5 top t4 {rso5}
C_5 top t4 3.3n
* device drain-source voltages, max and min
BV1 vds1 0 V=v(m1)
BV2 vds2 0 V=v(m2)-v(m1)
BV3 vds3 0 V=v(m3)-v(m2)
BV4 vds4 0 V=v(m4)-v(m3)
BV5 vds5 0 V=v(top)-v(m4)
BMX vdsmax 0 V=max(max(max(v(vds1),v(vds2)),max(v(vds3),v(vds4))),v(vds5))
BMN vdsmin 0 V=min(min(min(v(vds1),v(vds2)),min(v(vds3),v(vds4))),v(vds5))
* standing current drawn from the capacitor by this stack and its string, in microamps
BI istk 0 V=(v(hvp)-v(top))/4.5k*1e6
* constants visible to the control script
VPN pn 0 {nst}
VPR pr 0 {vrate}
VPC prc 0 {vratecold}
VPS pstr 0 {rstr}
VPV pvoffnom 0 {voffnom}
VL1 pl25 0 {leak25}
VL2 pl70 0 {leak70}
VL3 plm20 0 {leakm20}
.include stack_static.ctl
.end
